/// Complete 1:1 port of `iOS/KeyboardExtension/IOSKeyCanvasView.swift` (1,261 lines):
/// - `IOSKeycapNodeView` (`CALayer` continuous squircle `7.8pt`, cached SF Symbols, dual-weight `中/英`,
///   2-line Wubi radicals, swipe-up hints, `usesFunctionFill` & `isBlueAccent`, `0.065s` release)
/// - `IOSKeyCanvasView : UIInputView <UIInputViewAudioFeedback>` (`JuxuKeyCanvas`, causal multi-touch rollover,
///   sticky press-lock hysteresis, `123` hold-and-slide-to-insert, spacebar & whole-keyboard trackpad,
///   backspace swipe-up line clear & swipe-down undo, long-press alternates, edge-gate `touchesCancelled` rescue)
/// - `IOST9SidebarView` (scrollable idle punctuation column / live Pinyin syllable lock filter).

